---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy — Rakhi Battle 2026" noindex>
  <article class="shell legal">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: 24 August 2026.</p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>Nicknames, quiz answers, anonymous session identifiers, referral/UTM parameters, Family Court votes, payment status, and basic product events. We do not require phone numbers, email addresses, exact dates of birth, contact lists or accounts.</p>
    <h2>Why</h2>
    <p>To run challenges, calculate results, prevent simple duplicate voting, measure the funnel, process one-time purchases and improve the game.</p>
    <h2>Retention</h2>
    <p>Challenge and event data is intended to expire or be deleted after 45 days. Payment records may be retained longer where legally or operationally required by the payment provider.</p>
    <h2>Sharing</h2>
    <p>Anyone with a random challenge or result link can view the nicknames and result attached to it. Do not use full names or sensitive information. We do not sell personal data.</p>
    <h2>Optional Hall of Fame</h2>
    <p>A completed score appears on the public Hall of Fame only when both participants separately opt in. Public entries show the two nicknames, match score and a short unique battle code—not the private challenge ID, answers, email address or phone number.</p>
    <h2>Processors</h2>
    <p>Cloudflare hosts the service. Razorpay will process payment information when paid features are enabled. Their own policies apply to data they collect directly.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>A contact email will be added before paid launch. Until then, do not make a purchase if the checkout is not available.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
